---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="subversion" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Internal equipment manual · example",
        "사내 장비 신청 매뉴얼 · 예시",
        "社内の機材申請マニュアル · 例",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "History has a central home.",
        "이력은 중앙에 모입니다",
        "履歴を中央に集める",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="repository" data-central>
    <h3>
      {t("Central SVN repository", "중앙 SVN 저장소", "中央のSVNリポジトリ")}
    </h3>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>r18</b>
        <span>{t("Previous manual", "이전 매뉴얼", "以前のマニュアル")}</span>
      </li>
      <li class="latest">
        <b>r19</b>
        <span>
          {t(
            "Updated request instructions",
            "수정된 신청 안내",
            "更新した申請手順",
          )}
        </span>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Commit creates the shared revision here",
        "commit은 여기에 공유 리비전 생성",
        "commitはここに共有リビジョンを作成",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="copies">
    <div class="copy" data-editor>
      <p class="path">
        <b>01 / update ↓</b>
        <br />
        <b>02 / commit ↑</b>
      </p>
      <h3>
        {t("Editor’s working copy", "편집자의 작업 사본", "編集者の作業コピー")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Receive → edit → compare → commit",
          "받기 → 수정 → 비교 → 커밋",
          "取得 → 編集 → 比較 → コミット",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="copy" data-reader>
      <p class="path">
        <b>03 / update ↓</b>
      </p>
      <h3>
        {t("Colleague’s working copy", "동료의 작업 사본", "同僚の作業コピー")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t("Receive revision r19", "리비전 r19 받기", "リビジョンr19を取得")}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Offline: edit files. Repository access: commit history. Resolve conflicting changes before retrying.",
      "오프라인: 파일 편집. 저장소 접근: 이력 커밋. 충돌한 변경을 조정한 뒤 다시 시도합니다.",
      "オフライン：ファイル編集。リポジトリへのアクセス：履歴のコミット。競合を調整してから再試行します。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #f5f1e8;
    color: #4d3d24;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    border: 1px solid #9b8b6d;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  header p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .repository {
    border: 4px solid #6f5833;
    border-radius: 30px 30px 6px 6px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #fffdf9;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: auto;
  }
  .repository > p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  ol {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
  }
  li {
    flex: 1;
    border-top: 3px solid #9b8b6d;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }
  li b,
  li span {
    display: block;
  }
  li b {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  .latest {
    border-top-color: #4d3d24;
    background: #eee3ca;
    padding: 10px;
  }
  .copies {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .copy {
    background: #fffdf9;
    border: 1px solid #9b8b6d;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .path {
    min-height: 4.5em;
    border-left: 3px solid #6f5833;
    padding-left: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .copy h3 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .boundary {
    border-top: 1px solid #9b8b6d;
    padding-top: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @container (max-width:480px) {
    .copies {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    ol {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .path {
      min-height: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
